msgid "GD0108: The exported tool button is not in a tool class"
msgstr "GD0108：导出的工具按钮不在工具类中"

msgid "**Rule ID**"
msgstr "**规则 ID**"

msgid "GD0108"
msgstr "GD0108"

msgid "**Category**"
msgstr "**类别**"

msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

msgid "**Fix is breaking or non-breaking**"
msgstr "**修复是破坏性的还是非破坏性的**"

msgid "Non-breaking"
msgstr "非破坏性的"

msgid "**Enabled by default**"
msgstr "**默认启用**"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

msgid ""
"A property is annotated with the ``[ExportToolButton]`` attribute in a class "
"that is **not** annotated with the ``[Tool]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"某个属性使用了 ``[ExportToolButton]`` 特性进行标注，但其所在的类 **not** 使"
"用 ``[Tool]`` 特性进行标注。"

msgid "Rule description"
msgstr "规则说明"

msgid ""
"The ``[ExportToolButton]`` is used to create clickable buttons in the "
"inspector so, like every other script that runs in the editor, it needs to "
"be annotated with the ``[Tool]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"``[ExportToolButton]`` 用于在检查器中创建可点击按钮，与其他在编辑器中运行的脚"
"本一样，必须添加 ``[Tool]`` 特性标注。"

msgid "How to fix violations"
msgstr "如何解决违规情况"

msgid ""
"To fix a violation of this rule, add the ``[Tool]`` attribute to the class "
"that contains the member annotated with the ``[ExportToolButton]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"要修复违反该规则的情况，请将 ``[Tool]`` 特性添加到包含带有 "
"``[ExportToolButton]`` 特性的成员的类上。"

msgid "When to suppress warnings"
msgstr "何时抑制警告"

msgid ""
"Do not suppress a warning from this rule. The clickable buttons in the "
"inspector won't be functional if their script is not annotated with the "
"``[Tool]`` attribute."
msgstr ""
"请勿禁用此规则警告。若脚本未添加 ``[Tool]`` 特性标注，检查器中的可点击按钮将"
"无法正常使用。"
